        },
        "SkillDesc": {
          "TableId": "/Game/Text/ST_UI_GYJ.ST_UI_GYJ",
          "Key": "Character9_SkillDescFull",
          "SourceString": "在第一，第三，第五回合中随机揭示一条命运的启言。\r\n命运的启言1：展示本局藏品的总件数\r\n命运的启言2：随机展示1件最高品质藏品的轮廓\r\n命运的启言3：随机显示3件藏品\r\n命运的启言4：随机展示6件藏品的品质\r\n命运的启言5：随机展示6件藏品的轮廓\r\n命运的启言6：展示本局随机一件最高品质藏品的价值\r\n命运的启言1-5概率均等，命运的启言6概率始终为15%。",
          "LocalizedString": "Randomly reveals one of Fate's Prophecies in rounds 1, 3, and 5.\r\nFate's Prophecy 1: Reveals the total number of collectibles in the match.\r\nFate's Prophecy 2: Reveals the silhouette of 1 random collectible of the highest rarity.\r\nFate's Prophecy 3: Randomly reveals 3 collectibles.\r\nFate's Prophecy 4: Randomly reveals the rarity of 6 collectibles.\r\nFate's Prophecy 5: Randomly reveals the silhouettes of 6 collectibles.\r\nFate's Prophecy 6: Reveals the value of 1 random collectible of the highest rarity in the match.\r\nFate's Prophecy 1–5 are equally likely to appear, while Fate's Prophecy 6 always has a 15% chance of appearing."
        },
